  message: "## Addendum: standard agent autonomy applies — no needs_human_review at any stage\n\nThe Option-C recommendation in the framing post (open ADR-0029 + amend ADR-0024) and the resolutions in the follow-up post are the agent's call to make and ratify. ADRs are not on AGENTS.md's governance file list (governance is `.githooks/**`, `.agent/**`, specific scripts, CODEOWNERS, AUTONOMOUS_MODE, ALLOWED_WEBSITES, AGENTS.md); `docs/adr/` is editorial. ADR-0028 was filed Draft → Accepted by an agent (the WI-turin-pajuk audit close-out) without human pre-approval; ADR-0029 follows the same lifecycle.\n\n**Implication:** when this item's wave comes up, the agent files ADR-0029 draft + amends ADR-0024 + lands axis_meta_keys.py + drift linter + producer_coherence.py extension + by-axis view extension + property test in one PR-group, marks ADR-0029 Accepted on land (mirroring ADR-0028 Phase 1's posture), and proceeds to Phases 2-4 as scheduled. Human review at PR-merge is the standard checkpoint — no pre-flagging needed."  # c79d
